  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rebuild and strengthened Bolgrad Civil Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a result of the war in Ukraine, a significant part of the population is in need of psychosocial support. This project support the capacity building of IAS partner Charity Fund &quot;Gift&quot; to provide Psycho-Social Support to families, children, elderly and IDPs, while at the same time building its ability to competently provide services and network with government and other civil society organisations. This exercise become a leverage for rebuilding civil society engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
